  "description": "SAJGEU crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H64 Br6 Cl2 Er6 N24 O28,13(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er1 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er6 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.841-4.886 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.81-172.10°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C94H116Br6Cl2Er6N24O42. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
